// Level 1: "The Sunken Halls". Coordinates are pixels of the design drawing `lvl1.png`
// (x east, y south; 14 px = 1 m). Pixel (409.5, 1228) is world (0, -18): the arena's north wall.
// Format: see src/level/layout.rs. Rects are (x0, y0, x1, y1).
